{
  "name": "Blood Curse of the Exorcist",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you choose one creature you can see within 30 feet of you that is Charmed or Frightened, or which is under a possession effect. The target creature is no longer Charmed, Frightened, or possessed.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> A creature that Charmed, Frightened, or possessed the target of your curse takes 3d6 psychic damage and must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw or be Stunned until the end of your next turn.</p>",
